ame_prefix": true, "format": true}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveText"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["## Qwen Image 2.1 · 提示词强化（已优化）\n\n只做**提示词改写**，不出图。输入一句中文/大白话，输出结构化专业提示词。\n\n**本次优化**\n- 新增核心节点 `Save Text`：改写结果会**同时**存成 txt 文件，\n  方便复制到别的工具，也方便在 RunningHub 上把文字暴露成应用输出。\n- 保留 3 个 `Preview Any`：分别查看改写后的提示词、PE 结果对象、诊断信息。\n\n**用法**\n1. 在 `Qwen Image 2.1 PE Rewrite T8` 的 `user_prompt` 写需求。\n2. `output_language` 选 `中文` 就出中文提示词，`English` 出英文。\n3. `transparent_rgba` 打开 = 追加透明背景要求。\n4. `model_lifetime`：`after_run` 跑完释放显存（推荐，12G 显存必选）；\n   `keep_loaded` 连续改写更快但占显存。\n\n**上游模型**：`t2i_model` = 文生图改写，`edit_model` = 看图改写（1~10 张参考图）。\n想用 Heretic 版本就把 `t2i_model` 换成 `pe_t2i_heretic-Q4_K_M.gguf`。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "使用说明 / 优化点", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [430, 340], "pos": [-90, 220], "id": 301, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"name": "latent", "label": "latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent"}, {"name": "ratio_source", "links": [6], "label": "ratio_source", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "ratio_source"}], "size": [310, 142], "pos": [900, 405], "widgets_values": [1024, true], "inputs": [{"name": "pe_result", "link": 4, "label": "pe_result", "type": "PE_RESULT", "localized_name": "pe_result"}, {"widget": {"name": "resolution"}, "name": "resolution", "label": "resolution", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "resolution"}, {"widget": {"name": "follow_input_size"}, "name": "follow_input_size", "label": "follow_input_size", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "follow_input_size"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "QwenPECanvasT8", "title": "Qwen Image 2.1 PE Canvas", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"follow_input_size": true, "resolution": true}, "Node name for S&